Notable runtime dependencies (see requirements.txt for pinned versions):
- FastAPI, Uvicorn, Starlette (ASGI web stack)
- SQLAlchemy, aiosqlite (persistence)
- Pydantic / pydantic-settings (configuration)
- Passlib, bcrypt, python-jose, cryptography (auth and secrets)
- Stripe Python SDK (billing; cards never stored by this application)
- Playwright, BeautifulSoup, lxml, httpx (scanning / HTTP)
- Google API client libraries and Twilio SDK (optional integrations)
- Ollama Python client (local model inference)

